.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-v2-plan-rate-phases-create - Create rate phase


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago v2 plan-rate-phases create   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Inserts a phase and renumbers later positions. The last phase must be indefinite and no earlier phase may be indefinite. Parent locking rules apply.
Requires the product catalog to be enabled and plan_rate_card write permission on the API key.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--billing-interval-cycle-count\fP=""
	Number of billing cycles. Only the final phase is indefinite, represented by null.

.PP
\fB--code\fP=""
	Code unique within the applied rate card.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for create

.PP
\fB--input\fP=""
	Complete JSON request body or @file.json

.PP
\fB--name\fP=""
	Name of the phase.

.PP
\fB--position\fP=""
	One-based sequence position.

.PP
\fB--rate-override\fP=""
	Pricing override. On update, null removes the existing override.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-key\fP=""
	Override the Lago API key

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	Override the Lago API URL

.PP
\fB--confirm\fP=""
	Confirm a dangerous operation with its resource identifier

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Print mutating requests without sending them

.PP
\fB--insecure\fP[=false]
	Allow insecure HTTP or TLS for self-hosted Lago

.PP
\fB--mode\fP=""
	Environment mode: live or test

.PP
\fB--no-retry\fP[=false]
	Disable automatic retries

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP="table"
	Output format: table, json, or yaml

.PP
\fB--profile\fP=""
	Named profile to use

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath expression applied to the response

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=30s
	Total request timeout

.PP
\fB--timing\fP[=false]
	Print request latency breakdown

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Print redacted request and response details


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  lago v2 plan-rate-phases create <plan_code> <applied_rate_card_code> --input @payload.json
  lago v2 plan-rate-phases create <plan_code> <applied_rate_card_code> --input @payload.json --output json  # full resource
.EE


